@startuml 09-componentes
title Diagrama de Componentes

package "horas-ufsj (Next.js/TypeScript)" {
  [app/api] as ApiRoutes
  [lib/auth] as Auth
  [lib/schemas] as Schemas
  [components/ds] as DS
  [prisma] as Prisma
}

package "worker-ia (Python)" {
  [config.py] as Config
  [database.py] as Database
  [drive_service.py] as DriveService
  [gemini_service.py] as GeminiService
  [main.py\n(worker)] as Main
  [orchestrator.py] as Orchestrator
}

ApiRoutes --> Auth : valida sessão/permissões
ApiRoutes --> Schemas : valida payloads (Zod)
ApiRoutes --> Prisma : acesso a dados
DS --> ApiRoutes : consome via fetch/hooks

Main --> Config
Main --> Database
Main --> DriveService
Main --> GeminiService
Orchestrator --> Database
Orchestrator --> GeminiService

Database --> Prisma : mesmo schema/\nbanco PostgreSQL

@enduml
